SUMMARY:[Federal Maine-Related] Impact Aid Programs
DESCRIPTION:The U.S. Department of Education (Department) amends the regul
 ations that govern Impact Aid Programs (IAP) to make technical changes\, t
 o include correcting grammatical\, spelling\, and typographical errors\; c
 orrecting or updating statutory authority citations and regulatory cross-r
